            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/tfs/" title="View all posts in TFS" rel="category tag">TFS</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2008/09/tfs-screencasts-part-2-scrum-for-team-system-features/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on TFS Screencasts &#8211; Part 2 &#8211; Scrum For Team System Features"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="726 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/09/04/tfs-screencasts-part-2-scrum-for-team-system-features.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
